      en: ["Opened in 1960 as Nigeria's first modern cement factory.", "Owned by Lafarge Africa PLC, formerly WAPCO.", "The Ewekoro II expansion was commissioned in 2011.", "Leader in utilizing alternative fuels like palm kernel shells.", "Located in the strategic industrial corridor of Ogun State.", "A major supplier for the Lagos metropolitan construction boom."],
